  "releaseNotes": "Initial preview of YMJake.RocketMQ.\nProducer: standard / batch / FIFO / timed / priority / transactional / recall / lite messages.\nSimple and push consumers over the gRPC proxy\nFIFO listeners with local redelivery\nretry backoff and dead-letter forwarding.\nLitePushConsumer and LiteSimpleConsumer with runtime lite subscriptions.\nACL request signing / message-body digest checks / telemetry stream and reconnect.",
